<!-- Banner Section -->
<div style="width: 100%; margin-top: 20px; border-radius: 10px; background: #4C42CF; padding: 40px 30px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 24px;">
    <div style="color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.1;">
        Teaching Foundations of AI Programming [Python]
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Welcome Section -->
<h2>Welcome!</h2>

<p>This professional learning module is designed to help you prepare to teach CodeAI's <b>Foundations of AI Programming</b> from the <a href="https://studio.code.org/courses/artificial-intelligence-foundations-2025" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">AI Foundations Curriculum</a>.</p>

<p>The Foundations of AI Programming content is designed for 9th through 12th grade students.</p>

<!-- Goals Section -->
<div style="margin: 20px auto; width: 90%; max-width: 900px; background-color: #F7F7FB; border: 1px solid #E4E2F8; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px;">
<h2 style="margin-top: 0;">In this module, you will:</h2>
<p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;">• Become acquainted with lessons from the Foundations of AI Programming curriculum.</p>
<p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;">• Understand the key components of computational thinking: pattern recognition, abstraction, decomposition, and algorithms.</p>
<p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;">• Learn Python programming basics using CodeAI's engaging Neighborhood Platform.</p>
<p style="margin: 0;">• Examine the ethical implications of technology.</p>
</div>

<p><b>Suggested Total Time:</b> 90 minutes<br>
<b>Lesson One Suggested Time:</b> 10 minutes</p>

<h2>Take the Pre-Survey</h2>

<p>CodeAI values and is responsive to feedback. Please fill out the pre-survey to tell us about who you are and how we can best support you.</p>

<a href="https://studio.code.org/form/exploring_generative_ai_selfpaced_pl_pre_survey" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="display: inline-block; background-color: #4C42CF; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: bold; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none;">Take the Pre-Survey</a>

